# Environment variables / secrets
.env*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.pdf
# 1. Ignoriraj sve unutar rag_knowledge foldera
rag_knowledge/*

# 2. Omogući (un-ignore) agent-10008 i shared foldere (kako bi Git uopće ušao u njih)
!rag_knowledge/agent-10008/
!rag_knowledge/shared/

# 3. Ignoriraj sav sadržaj unutar tih foldera
rag_knowledge/agent-10008/*
rag_knowledge/shared/*

# 4. Omogući (un-ignore) specifične fajlove koje želiš pratiti
!rag_knowledge/agent-10008/security_policy.md
!rag_knowledge/shared/system_overview.md
!rag_knowledge/shared/rag_instructions.md

/static_backup

